## How to Add Images

### Via GitHub Web Interface:
1. Go to your repository
2. Click **Add file** → **Upload files**
3. Select all your image files
4. Commit the changes

### Via Command Line:
```bash
# Clone your repo
git clone https://github.com/ryansullivan325-droid/website.git
cd website

# Copy your images into the assets folder
cp /path/to/your/images/* assets/

# Add and commit
git add assets/
git commit -m "Add project images"
git push
```
